Subject: [PATCH 1/6] rothko: adapt frameworks/base integration to Android 17

Official 24.0 target: 22de88b7b8eb979c816669c7963dee66ae4953cd
Recorded 23.2 baseline: c9a2ecda2cd81e8f84f016bade939a82383e46c7

Resolve against the 24.0 APIs and preserve device integration contracts.
Prefer the upstream codec naming and HAL-owned face preview interfaces.
Display persistence migration covers legacy and refactored stores.
SurfaceFlinger power notifications follow the upstream asynchronous result.
Details and companion dependencies are recorded in the project document
LINEAGE_24_MIGRATION_20261114.zh-CN.md.

Validation: whitespace and conflict-marker checks passed. Extracted
brightness persistence checks passed where applicable. Android compilation,
full platform tests and flashed 24.0 acceptance remain pending.
