Rothko LineageOS 24.0-20261115 shows an AOD present-fence warning while minute scheduling continues. The enabled draw controller latched failure until a display or window lifecycle change, leaving later minute ticks unable to start drawing. Re-arm from the existing scheduled clock callback only; retain bounded leases, stale-frame guards and the existing resource/flag opt-in.

